  "story": {
    "day": 134,
    "title": "Kaya's Evening",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was fourteen years old this month.",
      "Yesterday, she studied for her EIKEN exam on the fourteenth.",
      "She felt tired and thirsty, so she drank coffee.",
      "Her friends weren't here; some were absent.",
      "One friend had a fever and missed a concert.",
      "Kaya ate dinner carefully and took a little snack break.",
      "She saw an anime about wild wolves in battle on her PC.",
      "She laughed, \"What a chicken!\" at the scared one.",
      "Her own plan was to travel safely to see aurora appear.",
      "She wasn't scared to learn public culture.",
      "Finally, she sent greetings and sat close to her books.",
      "Tomorrow, she would arrive for the exam and wouldn't worry."
    ]
  }
}